A rabbit burrow hole seen from the front and slightly above: a dark oval opening in a mound of brown earth with a few small tufts of green grass around the rim. Wide and short.
Style: the same soft 3D clay cartoon look as the reference fox (smooth rounded shapes, soft studio light from the top left, gentle shading, saturated friendly colours). Single isolated object, centered, fills about 85% of the canvas, fully transparent background, no ground, no shadow, no text, no border.
